        "original_id": "17f0be11-5e87-54da-91e1-25bea1086843",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mark Ciardi, Herb Brooks, Kurt Russell, Kevin Costner\n- Films: Miracle, The Rookie, Invincible, The Game Plan, Secretariat, Million Dollar Arm, McFarland USA\n- Organizations: Mayhem, United States men's hockey team, Major League Baseball\n- Events: 1980 Winter Olympics\n\nFacts:\n- Mark Ciardi was born on August 19, 1961, and he is an American film producer and former Major League Baseball pitcher.\n- At Mayhem, Mark Ciardi produced The Rookie, Miracle, Invincible, The Game Plan, Secretariat, Million Dollar Arm, and Kevin Costner's McFarland USA.\n- Miracle is a 2004 American sports docudrama about the United States men's hockey team winning the gold medal at the 1980 Winter Olympics.\n- In Miracle, Herb Brooks is the head coach of the United States men's hockey team, and Kurt Russell portrays Herb Brooks.",
